5.Learn what semantic tags are and why they are important for SEO & accessibility. Compare semantic vs non-semantic tags.
	
	Sematic tag will describe the meaning and purpose of the content, SEO can better understand the structure and purpose of the webpage.
	example: header, article, main, section, footer.
	Non-semantic tag doesn't have any meaning. example: div and span 



